## Digital Dice Artix-7 constraints TEMPLATE
## IMPORTANT:
## Replace every <...> token with the actual package pin from your exact board's
## master XDC / reference manual. Do not use this file unchanged for bitstream generation.
##
## Example clock constraint for a 100 MHz oscillator:
# set_property -dict { PACKAGE_PIN <CLOCK_PIN> IOSTANDARD LVCMOS33 } [get_ports {clk}]
# create_clock -add -name sys_clk_pin -period 10.000 -waveform {0 5} [get_ports {clk}]
